      "category": "Text",
      "text": "For this reason, compliance by City Agencies\nwith the foregoing schedule of due dates for reports\nis of the utmost importance. In instances where this\ntime schedule cannot be met and the bill to be re-\nported on appears to be harmful to the interests of\nthe City, you should notify Mr. Condello to that ef-\nfect at once and advise him as to the probable date\non which he will receive your report.",
